  "reason": "The title and abstract discuss the importance of systematic reviews and meta-analyses of animal studies for translation, and highlight challenges. However, they do not report any quantitative measure of agreement between animal and human results, such as concordance rates or predictive values. The paper appears to be a review of the methodology and challenges rather than a quantitative analysis of translation success."
